	{ title = "The Hushed Bank: kill these as you meet them", note = "Rabid Dire Wolves roam the woods around the cemetery and Abercrombie, Starving Dire Wolves the hills north-east of him. Pygmy Venom Web Spiders are the small spiders, and few: most crawl along the Hushed Bank west of Raven Hill, fewer up north towards Sven's camp; they drop the venom too. Every ghoul of the cemetery's northern half can drop a fang. Wolves and the bigger spiders share the Westfall border, so pull with care.", goals = {
